1
00:00:00,285 --> 00:00:01,715
(Penny:)Thanks a lot, guys.

2
00:00:01,721 --> 00:00:02,791
(Bernadette:)What did we do?

3
00:00:02,789 --> 00:00:04,059
(Penny:)Before I made that call,

4
00:00:04,057 --> 00:00:05,357
(Penny:)my pig was alive and happy

5
00:00:05,358 --> 00:00:06,688
(Penny:)and rolling around in the mud.

6
00:00:06,693 --> 00:00:09,063
(Penny:)Now he's illegally buried
in our backyard

7
00:00:09,062 --> 00:00:11,362
(Penny:)next to my great-grandmother.

8
00:00:11,364 --> 00:00:13,594
(Amy:)Really?

9
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,500
(Bernadette:)They didn't eat him?

10
00:00:16,503 --> 00:00:18,373
(Sheldon:)No.

11
00:00:18,371 --> 00:00:21,041
(Penny:)He was a beloved member
of the family.

12
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,110
(Bernadette:)The breakfast meat family?

13
00:00:25,878 --> 00:00:27,308
(Penny:)It's not funny.

14
00:00:27,313 --> 00:00:28,783
(Penny:)You're up.
Call your mother.

15
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:30,282
(Amy:)Oh, maybe later.

16
00:00:30,283 --> 00:00:33,013
(Amy:)Your pig dying
made me sad.

17
00:00:33,019 --> 00:00:35,019
(Amy:)And a little hungry.

18
00:00:35,021 --> 00:00:36,521
(Penny:)Phone, now.

19
00:00:36,523 --> 00:00:38,223
(Amy:)Okay. Okay.

20
00:00:38,224 --> 00:00:39,854
(Amy:)Fine.

21
00:00:42,628 --> 00:00:43,998
(Amy:)Hi, Mom.

22
00:00:43,997 --> 00:00:45,327
(Penny:)Try dialing.

23
00:00:47,032 --> 00:00:48,862
(Amy:)You saw that, huh?

24
00:00:52,771 --> 00:00:55,141
(Amy:)Hi, Mom. How are you doing?

25
00:00:56,375 --> 00:00:57,605
(Amy:)Oh, good.

26
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,240
(Amy:)How's work?

